{"cues":[{"sectionId":"concept","start":0,"end":17.12},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":18.32,"end":30.96},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":32.88,"end":43.36}],"captions":[{"sectionId":"concept","start":0,"end":2.48,"text":"加上第三個互相垂直的座標，"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":2.88,"end":9.44,"text":"距離關係就變成 x² + y² + z² = r²。"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":10.4,"end":11.68,"text":"球面是一個表面。"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":12.16,"end":14.56,"text":"旋轉它的圖像只會改變視角，"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":14.76,"end":17.12,"text":"不會改變大小或方程式。"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":18.32,"end":20.8,"text":"固定半徑 3、切片高度 0，"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":21.12,"end":24.64,"text":"把球面旋轉到 90 和 180 度。"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":25.36,"end":27.92,"text":"檢查哪些測量值保持不變。"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":29.12,"end":30.96,"text":"旋轉視角改變了什麼？"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":32.88,"end":34.88,"text":"旋轉視角改變了什麼？"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":36.16,"end":40.16,"text":"請根據剛才測試的模型或程式選擇答案。"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":40.88,"end":43.36,"text":"回饋會說明不同選項的差異。"}]}